OL,3,GNEWSA'Having a stroke has been my      
OL,4,Asuperpower'                            
OL,6,F"It's like my superpower, because what 
OL,7,Fhappened to me gave me insight into    
OL,8,Fwhat this is, what it can do to you    
OL,9,Fmentally and physically."              
OL,11,FJason Vincent was 53 and a property    
OL,12,Fdeveloper who had never been ill, when 
OL,13,Fa stroke suddenly changed his life     
OL,14,Fforever.                               
OL,16,FOne weekend he felt "off", and within a
OL,17,Fshort time he could not walk and was   
OL,18,Fleft lying on the floor in his hallway,
OL,19,Fas he young son looked on, paralysed on
OL,20,Fhis right-hand side.                   
