OL,3,GNEWSA'Having a stroke has been my      
OL,4,Asuperpower'                            
OL,6,F"As an adult, I have never felt as     
OL,7,Fvulnerable as I did then", said        
OL,8,FVincent, now 56 and working in gym     
OL,9,Ftherapy at brain injury charity Headway
OL,10,Fin Stoke-on-Trent, helping others going
OL,11,Fthrough what he did.                   
